{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"mlip","text":"<p>Minimal, MLIP\u2011first workflows for molecular simulation. The goal is to keep setup and execution predictable while surfacing the ML interatomic potential (MLIP) runs front\u2011and\u2011center.</p>"},{"location":"#quickstart","title":"Quickstart","text":"<pre><code>conda env create -f environment.yml\nconda activate mlip\npip install -e .\nmlip --help\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"#typical-flow","title":"Typical Flow","text":"<ol> <li><code>prep</code> \u2014 build the solvated system with AmberTools/tleap</li> <li><code>mdequil</code> \u2014 equilibrate with classical force field (optional)</li> <li><code>salt</code> \u2014 adjust ions / hydroxide (optional)</li> <li><code>orb-prep</code> \u2014 prepare ORB runs</li> <li><code>orb-submit</code> \u2014 submit ORB runs to Slurm</li> <li><code>plumed-cv</code> \u2014 write <code>plumed.dat</code> in per-run CV dirs (optional)</li> </ol>"},{"location":"#design-notes","title":"Design Notes","text":"<ul> <li>MLIP runs are the center of the workflow; prep exists to make them reliable.</li> <li>Each command is YAML\u2011driven and writes outputs under <code>systems/&lt;system&gt;/&lt;prefix&gt;_&lt;buffer&gt;/</code>.</li> <li><code>mlip</code> is independent from <code>qmmd</code> and shares no runtime linkage.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"analysis/dihedral/","title":"dihedral","text":"<p>Dihedral time\u2011series analysis with <code>cpptraj</code>.</p> <pre><code>mlip dihedral configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/analysis/dihedral.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"analysis/dihedral/#plotting","title":"Plotting","text":"<pre><code>python plotting/plot_dihedral_timeseries.py \\\n  --runs-path systems/&lt;system&gt;/&lt;prefix&gt;_&lt;buffer&gt;/orb/&lt;bench_tag&gt; \\\n  --labels double5,single5,single10,double10,single15,double15 \\\n  --window 50 \\\n  --out reports/dihedrals.png\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"analysis/hbond/","title":"hbond","text":"<p>Hydrogen\u2011bond time\u2011series and lifetime analysis with <code>cpptraj</code>.</p> <pre><code>mlip hbond configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/analysis/hbond.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"analysis/radgyr/","title":"radgyr","text":"<p>Radius of gyration time\u2011series analysis with <code>cpptraj</code>.</p> <pre><code>mlip radgyr configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/analysis/radgyr.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"analysis/rdf/","title":"rdf","text":"<p>Radial distribution function analysis with <code>cpptraj</code>.</p> <pre><code>mlip rdf configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/analysis/rdf.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"analysis/rdf/#plotting","title":"Plotting","text":"<pre><code>python plotting/rdf_hist.py \\\n  --root systems/&lt;system&gt;/&lt;prefix&gt;_&lt;buffer&gt;/orb/&lt;bench_tag&gt; \\\n  --label rdf_1_HD_WAT_O \\\n  --out reports/rdf_hist.png\n</code></pre> <pre><code>python plotting/rdf_bv_hydrogens.py \\\n  --root systems/&lt;system&gt;/&lt;prefix&gt;_&lt;buffer&gt;/orb/&lt;bench_tag&gt; \\\n  --out reports/rdf_bv_hydrogens.png\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"analysis/rmsd/","title":"rmsd","text":"<p>RMSD time\u2011series analysis with <code>cpptraj</code>.</p> <pre><code>mlip rmsd configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/analysis/rmsd.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"workflow/mdequil/","title":"mdequil","text":"<p>NVT/NPT equilibration with Amber <code>sander</code>.</p>"},{"location":"workflow/mdequil/#command","title":"Command","text":"<pre><code>mlip mdequil configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/mdequil/mdequil.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"workflow/mdequil/#outputs","title":"Outputs","text":"<ul> <li><code>min.in</code>, <code>heat.in</code>, <code>equil-nvt.in</code>, <code>equil-npt.in</code></li> <li><code>run.sh</code> and stage outputs (<code>*.out</code>, <code>*.rst7</code>, <code>*.nc</code>)</li> </ul>"},{"location":"workflow/mlip/","title":"mlip","text":"<p>Prepare and submit MLIP (ORB) runs.</p>"},{"location":"workflow/mlip/#commands","title":"Commands","text":"<pre><code>mlip orb-prep configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/orb/orb.yaml\nmlip orb-submit configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/orb/orb.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"workflow/mlip/#optional-plumed-cv-setup","title":"Optional: PLUMED CV setup","text":"<pre><code>mlip plumed-cv configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/orb-meta/plumed/plumed.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"workflow/mlip/#outputs","title":"Outputs","text":"<ul> <li><code>run.sh</code>, <code>slurm.sh</code> (if configured)</li> <li><code>main.py</code> runner</li> <li><code>spec.yaml</code></li> </ul> <p>For <code>plumed-cv</code>: - <code>plumed.dat</code> - <code>cv_spec.yaml</code></p>"},{"location":"workflow/prep/","title":"prep","text":"<p>Prepare a solvated system with AmberTools <code>tleap</code>.</p>"},{"location":"workflow/prep/#command","title":"Command","text":"<pre><code>mlip prep configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/prep/prep.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"workflow/prep/#outputs","title":"Outputs","text":"<ul> <li><code>&lt;prefix&gt;.parm7</code></li> <li><code>&lt;prefix&gt;.rst7</code></li> <li><code>spec.yaml</code></li> </ul>"},{"location":"workflow/salt/","title":"salt","text":"<p>Post\u2011equilibration system adjustment. Removes a counterion and converts the furthest water to hydroxide.</p>"},{"location":"workflow/salt/#command","title":"Command","text":"<pre><code>mlip salt configs/&lt;molecule&gt;/salt/salt.yaml\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"workflow/salt/#outputs","title":"Outputs","text":"<ul> <li><code>ready.rst7</code>, <code>ready.parm7</code>, <code>ready.xyz</code></li> <li><code>cpptraj_*.in</code> and <code>cpptraj_*.out</code></li> </ul>"}]}